<section id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Optional configuration (not in main results).</h4>

<div id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For 6D tasks like <span id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">halfcheetah-medium-expert-v2</span>, we use the same <math id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B{=}3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B{=}3</annotation></semantics></math> (729 cells), <math id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M{=}27" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M{=}27</annotation></semantics></math> routed codes, and (online/eval) RTGs of <math id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(12000,6000)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>12000</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6000</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(12000,6000)</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
